<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><title>Power BI Sales Dashboard</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#eef1f6;--card:#fff;--ink:#17233d;--mut:#5d6b85;--hd:#12294f;--ac:#f2c811;--line:#d9dfea;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0e1626;--card:#17233d;--ink:#e8edf7;--mut:#9aa8c4;--hd:#0a1730;--line:#2a3a5c}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0e1626;--card:#17233d;--ink:#e8edf7;--mut:#9aa8c4;--hd:#0a1730;--line:#2a3a5c}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.4 "Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}
header{background:var(--hd);color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:700}header h1 b{color:var(--ac)}header span{color:#b9c6e0;font-style:italic;font-size:13px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:26px}.logo i{width:7px;background:var(--ac);display:block;border-radius:1px}
main{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 16px 28px}
.sl{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.sl label{flex:1 1 140px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
select,button{font:inherit;padding:7px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink)}
button{cursor:pointer;align-self:flex-end}select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ac);outline-offset:1px}
.k{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.c{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;min-width:0}
.k .c{border-top:4px solid var(--ac)}.k small{color:var(--mut);font-size:12px}.k strong{display:block;font-size:26px;margin-top:2px}
.g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:10px}
.c h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px}.w{position:relative;height:240px}
.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
footer{color:var(--mut);font-size:12px;margin-top:12px}
</style></head><body>
<header><div class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><i style="height:12px"></i><i style="height:19px"></i><i style="height:26px"></i></div><h1><b>Power BI</b> Sales Dashboard</h1><span>From data to insights</span></header>
<main>
<div class="sl" id="sl"></div>
<div class="k" id="k"></div>
<div class="g">
<div class="c wide"><h2>Monthly sales trend (₹)</h2><div class="w"><canvas id="ch1" role="img" aria-label="Monthly sales line chart"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="c"><h2>Sales by product (₹)</h2><div class="w"><canvas id="ch2" role="img" aria-label="Sales by product bar chart"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="c"><h2>Sales by category</h2><div class="w"><canvas id="ch3" role="img" aria-label="Category donut chart"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="c"><h2>Sales by region (₹)</h2><div class="w"><canvas id="ch4" role="img" aria-label="Region column chart"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="c"><h2>Sales by state (₹)</h2><div class="w"><canvas id="ch5" role="img" aria-label="State bar chart"></canvas></div></div>
</div>
<footer>Sample practice data, 1,200 orders in 2025. Use the slicers above to filter every visual.</footer>
</main>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
